WEBVTT

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.909
In fact, here's some footage
from about 1984.

00:02:02.933 --> 00:02:08.052
It wasn't until 79
I won my first amateur championship,

00:02:08.076 --> 00:02:12.853
and then, by 81, I was 14,
and I won my first world championship,

00:02:14.222 --> 00:02:16.390
which was amazing to me,

00:02:16.414 --> 00:02:19.479
and in a very real sense,
that was the first real victory I had.

00:02:19.503 --> 00:02:20.668
Oh, watch this.

00:02:20.692 --> 00:02:23.227
This is a Casper slide,
where the board's upside down.

00:02:23.251 --> 00:02:24.839
Mental note on that one.

00:02:24.863 --> 00:02:26.323
(Laughter)

00:02:26.347 --> 00:02:27.827
And this one here?

00:02:27.851 --> 00:02:29.639
An ollie.